  biomeName: Tier 12 East Reserve
  minDepthMeters: 4550
  maxDepthMeters: 5075
  shortDescription: Reserved biome slot for Tier 12 / East. The 108-biome matrix
    expects a bespoke authored identity here; final lore and geology are pending
    expansion from the master vision.
  isPlaceholder: 1
  visitPurpose: Abyss biome. Come here for specialized runs, rarer materials, and
    read walls, fissures, and major vertical routes.
  commonRewardHook: Reliable value comes from Iron Composite and Electrolyte Salts.
  rareRewardHook: 'The rare pull is real: Rare Earth Dust and Stabilizer Coil.'
  landmarkIdentity: Tier 12 East Reserve reads through walls, fins, fissures, and
    giant vertical breaks. Landmarks should feel scarce but memorable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are scarce. Relief should come from one clear
    nook, not constant cover.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: vertical trap geometry and hard commitment, then
    overstaying for loot. Creature pressure stays medium_to_high.'
  extractionFocus: 'Sparse node hits and salvage pockets hidden in weak-visibility
    terrain. Mid-depth: work edges, cracks, and vertical seams, then return before
    greed stretches the route.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is rare mound, trench lip, or wreck rise. This
    slot should read through single trench mouth or silt catacomb seam; use walls
    and breaks to mark route commitment.
